    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels so selfish to keep trying to \"fix\" myself when the world would literally be better off without my influence. like, if i'm just a source of harm, isn't the most responsible thing to just... stop being a factor? to just remove the problem entirely? it feels like any \"positive change\" is just a lie i'm telling myself to feel better, but the reality is that i'm just a net negative.",
